1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:02,091
Nibs: Tonight.

2
00:00:02,591 --> 00:00:03,847
Nibs: We get. The cookie.

3
00:00:12,446 --> 00:00:15,297
Bubbles: Blub-tastic! I'm here! Um, why am I here?

4
00:00:15,196 --> 00:00:16,446
Nibs: The mission, Bubbles!

5
00:00:16,347 --> 00:00:17,730
Bubbles: Ooooh, the mission!

6
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,280
Bubbles: What mission?

7
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:25,040
Nibs: Mochi! Wake up! Mission time!

8
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:27,225
Mochi: Hm?

9
00:00:28,025 --> 00:00:29,171
Nibs: There's a cookie.

10
00:00:29,371 --> 00:00:30,605
Mochi: Snack?

11
00:00:35,206 --> 00:00:36,969
Nibs: Okay, team. Here's the plan.

12
00:00:36,969 --> 00:00:41,067
Nibs: The last honey oat cookie is in the jar, way up on the kitchen counter.

13
00:00:41,167 --> 00:00:47,207
Nibs: Step one, cross the slippery floor. Step two, sneak past the moonbeams. Step three, climb to the top!

14
00:00:47,307 --> 00:00:49,024
Bubbles: Can I be the climber?

15
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:50,034
Nibs: You're a fish.

16
00:00:49,935 --> 00:00:51,451
Bubbles: A climbing fish!

17
00:00:51,651 --> 00:00:53,975
Mochi: Can I be the sleeper?

18
00:00:54,176 --> 00:00:56,198
Nibs: Everybody ready? Mission time!

19
00:00:58,999 --> 00:01:01,603
Everyone: Sneak, sneak, quiet feet!

20
00:01:01,704 --> 00:01:04,693
Everyone: We're the Snack Squad, can't be beat!

21
00:01:05,093 --> 00:01:07,710
Everyone: Tip, tip, tiptoe slow!

22
00:01:07,810 --> 00:01:10,452
Everyone: Off to the cookie, here we go!

23
00:01:15,052 --> 00:01:16,675
Nibs: Careful. Tiptoe. Tiptoe.

24
00:01:16,875 --> 00:01:18,091
Nibs: Whoa, whoa, whoaaa!

25
00:01:28,191 --> 00:01:29,660
Bubbles: Wheeeee! Look at me!

26
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:42,243
Nibs: Step one. Complete.

27
00:01:43,942 --> 00:01:45,391
Bubbles: Again! Again!

28
00:01:45,790 --> 00:01:46,757
Nibs: No again!

29
00:01:49,356 --> 00:01:52,806
Nibs: Stop! Don't touch the moonbeams. They're super secret lasers!

30
00:01:53,206 --> 00:01:55,503
Nibs: Can you help us count the moonbeams? Ready?

31
00:01:56,102 --> 00:01:57,276
Everyone: One!

32
00:01:57,775 --> 00:01:58,946
Everyone: Two!

33
00:01:59,445 --> 00:02:00,618
Everyone: Three!

34
00:02:01,118 --> 00:02:02,257
Everyone: Four!

35
00:02:02,757 --> 00:02:03,984
Everyone: Five!

36
00:02:04,384 --> 00:02:06,233
Nibs: Five moonbeams! Thank you, friend!

37
00:02:12,332 --> 00:02:14,195
Bubbles: Limbo, limbo, blub!

38
00:02:25,795 --> 00:02:27,554
Mochi: Ooh. Warm.

39
00:02:28,653 --> 00:02:31,036
Nibs: Mochi, no napping! Push, Bubbles, push!

40
00:02:31,036 --> 00:02:33,231
Bubbles: Pushing! Wait, what are we pushing?

41
00:02:40,331 --> 00:02:41,867
Bubbles: What's that noise?

42
00:02:41,967 --> 00:02:43,818
Nibs: The robot vacuum! It's awake!

43
00:02:45,018 --> 00:02:47,629
Bubbles: It wants to eat us! Roll, roll, roll!

44
00:02:48,229 --> 00:02:50,258
Nibs: Which way should we go? Left? Or right?

45
00:02:52,858 --> 00:02:54,091
Nibs: Right! Good thinking!

46
00:03:07,191 --> 00:03:08,292
Nibs: Mochi, run!

47
00:03:08,491 --> 00:03:10,099
Mochi: I'm running!

48
00:03:27,699 --> 00:03:29,010
Nibs: Phew. That was close.

49
00:03:33,811 --> 00:03:35,272
Nibs: Step three. The tower!

50
00:03:35,472 --> 00:03:41,683
Nibs: Mochi at the bottom, because she's the biggest. Bubbles in the middle. And me on the top, because I'm the smallest!

51
00:03:41,783 --> 00:03:43,651
Bubbles: Biggest, middle, smallest!

52
00:03:49,751 --> 00:03:51,570
Mochi: Mmmf.

53
00:03:59,670 --> 00:04:01,114
Bubbles: Blub! Splishy!

54
00:04:11,213 --> 00:04:12,474
Nibs: Almost. Almost.

55
00:04:23,074 --> 00:04:24,108
Nibs: We. Did it.

56
00:04:28,509 --> 00:04:30,182
Bubbles: Look how big it is!

57
00:04:34,783 --> 00:04:36,877
Mochi: Ah. Ahh. ACHOO!

58
00:04:44,978 --> 00:04:46,362
Mochi: Oops.

59
00:04:46,762 --> 00:04:47,914
Bubbles: The cookie.

60
00:04:48,314 --> 00:04:49,723
Nibs: I planned. Everything.

61
00:04:52,524 --> 00:04:55,339
Mochi: I'm sorry. It just. Fell in.

62
00:05:00,139 --> 00:05:01,544
Lily: What's all this noise?

63
00:05:02,144 --> 00:05:03,699
Lily: Were you three hungry?

64
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:08,036
Lily: Silly friends! You could have just asked me!

65
00:05:08,637 --> 00:05:14,112
Lily: Sunflower seeds for Nibs. Fish flakes for Bubbles. And a fishy biscuit for Mochi.

66
00:05:18,213 --> 00:05:20,098
Lily: Sharing is better than sneaking.

67
00:05:20,699 --> 00:05:23,128
Lily: And when you want something, what do you say?

68
00:05:23,728 --> 00:05:25,000
Everyone: Please!

69
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,372
Lily: And when someone shares with you?

70
00:05:27,973 --> 00:05:29,371
Everyone: Thank you!

71
00:05:32,471 --> 00:05:34,007
Nibs: Next time, we just ask!

72
00:05:34,208 --> 00:05:35,378
Bubbles: Ask what?

73
00:05:39,978 --> 00:05:42,564
Everyone: Snack Squad! Snack Squad!

74
00:05:42,964 --> 00:05:46,245
Everyone: We ask, we share, we're the best team ever!

75
00:06:05,846 --> 00:06:08,918
Everyone: Bye bye, friends! See you next time!

